    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375860/extras/24be0c0a593765141b2b255e8a5e6f0c.poster.avif?t=1709830842\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375860/extras/24be0c0a593765141b2b255e8a5e6f0c.webm?t=1709830842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375860/extras/24be0c0a593765141b2b255e8a5e6f0c.mp4?t=1709830842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Master the controls of your oddly shaped player to claim victory in this local-multiplayer competitive sports game. Quick reactions and stealthy steals are a must if you want to outscore your opponents in the field.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>2 to 4 player</strong> Local-Multiplayer (or up to 8 on custom maps!)</li><li>15 different versus maps</li><li><strong>Single-Player</strong> target-smash mode to help you hone your skills</li><li><strong>Custom Level Editor</strong></li><li>Steam Remote Play supported to play local versus online</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375860/extras/24be0c0a593765141b2b255e8a5e6f0c.poster.avif?t=1709830842\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375860/extras/24be0c0a593765141b2b255e8a5e6f0c.webm?t=1709830842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375860/extras/24be0c0a593765141b2b255e8a5e6f0c.mp4?t=1709830842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Master the controls of your oddly shaped player to claim victory in this local-multiplayer competitive sports game. Quick reactions and stealthy steals are a must if you want to outscore your opponents in the field.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>2 to 4 player</strong> Local-Multiplayer (or up to 8 on custom maps!)</li><li>15 different versus maps</li><li><strong>Single-Player</strong> target-smash mode to help you hone your skills</li><li><strong>Custom Level Editor</strong></li><li>Steam Remote Play supported to play local versus online</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Master the unique shape of your player and out-manoeuvre your opponents in this high speed local multiplayer sports game. Play 1v1 or 2v2 versus matches, or race against the clock solo in target smash.",
